SUMMARY:Echoes of Strings
DESCRIPTION:Swaradhya is a Bangalore-based World Fusion Instrumental Band blending Indian classical music with contemporary western genres. Led by sitarist Ashok Ayengar\, the band includes Natraj Nirvikar (piano\, keys\, guitar)\, Kapil Dalal (double bass)\, and Ashish Padiyar (percussion). Their repertoire spans original raga-based compositions fused with global rhythms (latin\, afro\, etc.)\, alongside fresh adaptations of Indian thumris and folk music. \nThis concert blends Indian Classical influences with contemporary acoustic expression to create a truly unique soundscape. Exploring emotion\, memory\, and nature through the voice strings\, the session invites audiences into inner reflection. The concert moves from meditative stillness to rhythmic exploration in a medley of cultural influences\, creating space for every listener to weave their own emotions\, memories and stories into the music. \nIn collaboration with: \n \nSupported by: \n \nVenue: Auditorium\n\n\nSwaradhya — Indian Roots\, Global Sounds\nRSVPs closed. Thank you for your interest.\n*Performers*: Ashok Ayengar\, Natraj Nirvikar\, Ashish Padiyar\, Kapil Dalal\n*Event Categories*: Music\, Performing Arts
URL:https://bangaloreinternationalcentre.org/event/echoes-of-strings/
LOCATION:Bangalore International Centre\, 7\, 4th Main Road\, Domlur II Stage\, Bangalore\, Karnataka\, 560071\, India
CATEGORIES:Music,Performing Arts
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://bangaloreinternationalcentre.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Thumbnail_EOS.jpg
END:VEVENT
