SUMMARY:Melodies and Memories
DESCRIPTION:A tribute to a voice that deserves to be heard across generations\, Melodies & Memories celebrates the extraordinary life and musical legacy of legendary playback singer Suman Kalyanpur. This session is an immersive journey through the songs\, stories and memories that defined one of Indian cinema’s most graceful and enduring voices. \nInterwoven with live performances are engaging anecdotes\, little-known facts and fascinating insights into the people\, collaborations and moments that shaped her career. Thoughtfully curated by Sandhya S Kumar\, the programme blends scholarship with nostalgia\, offering audiences an opportunity to rediscover Suman Kalyanpur’s timeless contribution to Indian film music. \nSupported by: \n    \nVenue: Auditorium\n\n\nA Tribute to Suman Kalyanpur\nRSVP here (https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSda0Bu9-BMyLHckCQQSYX5dmnmizGuf41TAoa4QBEBBEXkKyw/viewform?usp=pp_url)\n*Performers*: Prateek Chatterjee & Madhuvanti Chowdhury\, Samanvitha Sharma\, Govind Kurnool\, Srinivas Achar\n*Event Categories*: In Memory\, Music\, Performing Arts
URL:https://bangaloreinternationalcentre.org/event/melodies-and-memories/
LOCATION:Bangalore International Centre\, 7\, 4th Main Road\, Domlur II Stage\, Bangalore\, Karnataka\, 560071\, India
CATEGORIES:In Memory,Music,Performing Arts
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://bangaloreinternationalcentre.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Thumbnail_MM.jpg
END:VEVENT
